<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Pressure by foes, and pressure from our friends;</l><l>Pressure on pressure, till life nearly ends;</l><l>Pressed into knowing none to help but God,</l><l>Pressed into loving both the staff and rod.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Pressed into liberty where nothing clings,</l><l>Pressed into faith for hard and hopeless things;</l><l>Pressed into life, a life in Christ the Lord,</l><l>Pressed into life, the life of Christ outpoured.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
